Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.15,0:06:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这样 《刺杀4》呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if so, what is Stab 4 about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You re over thinking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我想多了还是你从没想过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I or did you ever make it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想吧 我不看这种电影是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just under think it, there's a reason I don't watch these movies?
