Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.67,0:06:13.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可是住在伍兹伯勒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We live in Woodsboro.
