Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以西德尼·普雷斯科特为原型{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trilogy is based off of Sidney Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为此她威胁要起诉他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then she threatened to sue them if they
