Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在《刺杀5》里还有时空穿越 是至今最差的一部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stab 5 has time travel, which is by far the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.74,0:06:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你每年都看不厌吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't you have enough about this story every year?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.99,0:06:36.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少伍兹伯勒是因此而知名的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least Woodsboro is known for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听见了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 我什么都没听到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, no, I didn't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.97,0:06:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍妮 别想吓我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jenny, don't try to scare me.
