Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你老这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.21,0:06:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.39,0:06:56.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了 我听到有声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.17,0:06:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你是想吓我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you re trying to scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.47,0:06:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.64,0:07:07.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没关房间的窗户{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must have left the window in my room open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.68,0:07:19.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 能接一下吗 玛妮 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Could you get that? Marnie? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好 你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Hello. Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:29.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛妮 你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marnie. Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:33.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你死前见到的最后一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the last person you ever gonna see alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:36.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.14,0:07:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对不起 我忍不住 - 你这个贱人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I am sorry. I had to. - You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:49.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一点都不好笑 - 有人每年都上当{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So not funny. - Somebody falls for it every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真不明白你为什么以此为乐...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see why you get off on this shi...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.48,0:08:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛妮 玛妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marnie? Marnie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演得不错 玛妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good one, Marnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.43,0:08:13.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关了灯 电话扔在地上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lights out, phone on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.47,0:08:17.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真应该导演恐怖片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you really should direct horror films.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你在哪...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wherever you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜猜 你想让我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lemme guess. You want me to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走过开着的门 然后你突然跳出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}walk by an open door frame so you can pop out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 时机 时机很完美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok. Timing, timing is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.15,0:08:38.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你的手机没装软件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't have the app on your phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:40.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能模仿鬼脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you can't talk like Ghostface.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你能吗 - 是的 我能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you? - Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 不是软件变声哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who is this? - Not an app.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.94,0:08:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是特雷弗吗 - 我听起来像特雷弗吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this Trevor? - Do I sound like a Trevor to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.07,0:08:53.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我当成导演 你在我的电影里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think of me as your director. You re in my movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有个有趣的角色 别演砸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a fun part so don't blow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.98,0:08:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么电影 - 玛妮也参演的电影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What movie? - Same one Marnie's in,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过她的戏份结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only her part got cut way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:03.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你 这个胸大无脑的金发妞儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you, you are the dumb blond with the big tits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.65,0:09:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在你死前会和你玩个痛快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have some fun with you before you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我成绩4分 智商135 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a 4.0 GPA and 135 IQ asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把玛妮怎么样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do with Marnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在剪接室的地上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's on the cutting room floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.23,0:09:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一点也不好玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.67,0:09:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是喜剧片 这是恐怖片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't a comedy, it's a horror film.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.73,0:09:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人生 有人死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People live, people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.31,0:09:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好开始逃命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'd better start running.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.23,0:11:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,《惊声尖叫4》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.67,0:11:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你觉得怎么样 - 我猜今天是纪念日吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you think? - Well, I guess today's the anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 孩子们 - 不 我指这个展示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kids... - No, I meant the display.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.67,0:11:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(《冲出黑暗》 "一个幸存者的真实故事" 今日下午一点)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.75,0:12:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很不错 - 我威胁店主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's good. - Told the owner
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你没大卖我就杀了他的猫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd kill his cat if you didn't get a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(警长)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:47.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,限速25码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woah, 25 to stay alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 抱歉长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Sorry Sheriff!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科比...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirby...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.32,0:13:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你上车前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ehi, before you get in the car,
