Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.15,0:13:16.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么 你做了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.37,0:13:18.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特雷弗昨晚给我打电话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trevor called me last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.11,0:13:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为什么给你打电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is he calling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你不接他的电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you won't take his calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.27,0:13:23.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他知道咱俩是好姐妹 他想知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he knows I have your ear and he wants to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.02,0:13:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 知道什么 - 知道你有多生气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Know what? - How upset you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 可以先不聊这个吗 - 好 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can we just not talk about this? - Fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.05,0:13:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特雷弗昨晚给我打电话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Trevor called me last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.69,0:13:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也给你打了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He called you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他担心你表姐的到来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's afraid your cousin coming to Woodsboro
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会让你无暇考虑他的歉意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is distracting you from knowing how sorry he really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.16,0:13:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真是别出心裁 - 上帝啊...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, that's inventive. - God...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.77,0:13:49.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便问一句 你看《死神》了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, by the way, have you seen the Grim Reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那《死亡天使》呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angel of Death?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:54.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你表姐 巡回签售的最后一站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your cousin. Last stop in a book tour,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始新生活的第一站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}first stop in a road to a new life.
