Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.06,0:23:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.04,0:23:14.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然 我是最后一个知道的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the whole world knows about it before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她想介入调查 警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wants to be a part of the investigation, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.91,0:23:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行 等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok. Hang on. Uhm, are you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.31,0:23:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我写过一本书是关于这桩案件的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}familiar with the phrase "I wrote a book on this" ?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.54,0:23:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加尔 恕我直言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gale, with all due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.28,0:23:32.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不觉得这有相关性...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see how that pertains to...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.26,0:23:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我写过关于这起案件的书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I wrote the book on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.99,0:23:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是《伍兹伯勒谋杀案》作者 加尔·威瑟斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The Woodsboro murders" by Gale Weathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.61,0:23:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你不再是记者了 加尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you re not a reporter anymore, Gale.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.28,0:23:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And even if you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.43,0:23:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要把我当成媒体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't treat me like I'm the media.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.14,0:23:46.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时帮忙破案了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I helped solve these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.74,0:23:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,足足3次 还记得吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3 times, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.08,0:23:50.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我一起的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and me, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.17,0:23:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但我现在是警长了 加尔 - 又如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I am the Sheriff now, Gale. - Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.24,0:23:59.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不打算让我帮忙了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you re not gonna help you with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.37,0:24:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不可以这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.75,0:24:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行 那我自己干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right then, I am going rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.18,0:24:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直擅长此事 杜威{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what I am good at, Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.12,0:24:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what I know how to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.11,0:24:17.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的柠檬方蛋糕跟屁股一个味道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your lemon squares taste like ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.56,0:24:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是 很好吃 - 谢谢你 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They don't. They really don't. - Thank you, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.63,0:24:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 警长 - 什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sheriff. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.71,0:24:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几个高中学生来报案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a couple high school kids in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.53,0:24:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中两个说今天早上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two of them, they say they got threatening
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.52,0:24:32.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接到从受害人电话打来的威胁电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}phone calls this morning from the victims' phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.01,0:24:33.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的名字是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Names are
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.22,0:24:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥利维亚·莫里斯和吉尔·罗伯茨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Olivia Morris and Jill Roberts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.25,0:24:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是西德的表妹 该死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Sid's cousin. Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.08,0:24:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她们在这里 警长 - 吉尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right in here, Sheriff. - Hey, Jill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.41,0:24:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 西德尼 你好 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sidney. Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.17,0:24:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见到你真好 即使在这种情况下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nice to see you, even under the circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.40,0:24:51.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还好吗 - 还行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You ok? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.35,0:24:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你们其中两个接到电话吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So two of you got phone calls?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.67,0:24:54.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我们两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, us two.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.88,0:24:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最喜欢的恐怖片是哪部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"What's your favorite scary movie?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.92,0:24:59.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个杀手的声音 《刺杀》里的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the killer's voice. From Stab.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.44,0:25:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自 你明白的 来自你的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From, I mean you know, from your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.72,0:25:04.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是科比 她们的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Kirby, by the way. I am their friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.24,0:25:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杀手没打电话给你吗 - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And the killer didn't call you? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.30,0:25:11.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这会...这会很糟糕吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is...this is a bad thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.11,0:25:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是意味着我没她们活得长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that mean that I am not gonna live as long as these two?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.10,0:25:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 或许 当然不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...Maybe. Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.14,0:25:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过要小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just...just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.50,0:25:23.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天 听见了吗 我是下个目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God, did you hear that? I am gonna be next!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.05,0:25:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杜威 我不该来这 我该离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dewey, I shouldn't be here. I should leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.55,0:25:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕不行 西德尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am afraid that's not really possible, Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.33,0:25:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说你跟此案有关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, nobody thinks you're involved
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.01,0:25:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但任何人都有嫌疑 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but everyone's a suspect. I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.99,0:25:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,况且在你的车里发现的证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there was evidence in your car
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.71,0:25:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,证明杀手与你有关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}connecting the killer to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.32,0:25:37.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有可能是重要证人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may be a material witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.16,0:25:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 你会受到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you know, you'll have
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.14,0:25:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警方二十四小时的监视{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}24 hour police surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.30,0:25:45.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那倒是让人安心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.55,0:25:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是丽贝卡 我的天 亨利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Rebecca. Oh my fucking God, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.67,0:25:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 两个女孩被杀 大赚一笔了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! It's true. Two girls butchered. Pay day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.32,0:25:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对伍兹伯勒毫无好感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was so not feeling Woodsboro.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.29,0:26:01.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是像瘸腿公关 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was like LAME PR, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.28,0:26:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正振奋了 绝好的点子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, fuck me wow! Best idea ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.62,0:26:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利 回头打给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Henry, I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.06,0:26:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 我实在难以自禁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. I have to geek out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.13,0:26:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前没有机会跟你说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hadn't got a chance to say something earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.81,0:26:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见到你真荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's suck an honor to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.75,0:26:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 我是丽贝卡·沃尔特斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Rebecca Walters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.50,0:26:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.12,0:26:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小时候到处都是加尔·威瑟斯的精彩故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a kid it was all about top story with Gale Weathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.11,0:26:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是我的九十年代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were my 90s!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.54,0:26:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在是加尔·瑞利了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's Gale Riley now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.55,0:26:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为爱情放弃了事业 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave it all for love, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.18,0:26:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和杜威结婚多久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have you and Dewey been married?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.93,0:26:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 十年 - 跟你《刺杀3》里的角色一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ten years. - Oh, just like your characters in Stab 3. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.68,0:26:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有恶意 只是貌似{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't mean "Bad wow", it's just, it always
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.21,0:26:37.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怖片比现实里有更多浪漫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seemed like more of a horror movie romance than a real one
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.19,0:26:39.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为是电影 而现实中不会存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because it was a movie, and in real life it should never be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.50,0:26:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挖个洞 在这里爬出来 无论如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dug a hole. Climbing out, here. So anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.09,0:26:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放弃职业生涯的勇气实在让人佩服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kudos on being brave enough to drop off the professional map.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.97,0:26:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是否打算东山再起呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any plans on revitalizing your tarnished brand?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.35,0:26:53.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我将在两秒内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, in about 2 seconds I am
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.15,0:26:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的脸打得闪闪亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gonna revitalize your face... with my tarnished brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.48,0:26:58.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不减当年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.50,0:27:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhm, tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.66,0:27:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她真漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.80,0:27:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当一想到她的遭遇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you think about what she survived,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.50,0:27:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜她身上到处是伤痕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she must have scars everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.39,0:27:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小声点 拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shhhh, Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.73,0:27:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她母亲是我姐姐 我也有伤痕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her mom is my sister. I have scars too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.06,0:27:23.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从没人问起过我的伤痕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None ever asks me about my scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.61,0:27:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 罗伯茨太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sorry Mrs Roberts.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.33,0:27:28.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是指美好的伤痕 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She means nice scars, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.96,0:27:31.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.43,0:27:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你过得好吗 加尔呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you? How's Gale?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.74,0:27:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好 但是加尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am alright. But Gale,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.46,0:27:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就比较委屈了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's been hard on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.94,0:27:50.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小城镇 和来自小城镇的丈夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Small town. Small town husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.24,0:27:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么好写的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not much to write about.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.91,0:27:55.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个还好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.63,0:27:58.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾经在哪里看到过的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I read somewhere once
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.59,0:28:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"当你觉得事情不能再糟糕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Just when you think things can't get any worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.91,0:28:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时就真的不会了...有时 还会变好"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sometimes they don't...sometimes, they get better".
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.11,0:28:10.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西德尼·普雷斯科特的《走出黑暗》220页{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of Darkness by Sidney Prescott, page 220.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.59,0:28:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.69,0:28:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见到你真好 杜威{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nice to see you, Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.74,0:28:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起克服了很多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been through a lot together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.97,0:28:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get through this too, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.67,0:28:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.28,0:28:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 别紧张 别紧张 是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be good. It's ok. Relax, relax. It's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.58,0:29:01.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.32,0:29:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面有警察守着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are cops right out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.63,0:29:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不是忍者的对手 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No match for the ninja, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.13,0:29:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在西德尼·普雷斯科特的房子干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, what are you doing in the house of Sidney Prescott?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.01,0:29:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉在跟杰弗里·达默玩顶级厨师游戏(1994年美国杀人犯){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, that's like being on Top Chef with Jeffrey Dahmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.22,0:29:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你别靠近窗户{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you please get away from the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.92,0:29:18.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里不合适 再也不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've no right to be in here. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.14,0:29:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少安毋躁 我听说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on. I heard
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.54,0:29:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你接到杀手的电话 真的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you got a phone call from the killer. Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.50,0:29:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你有什么关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.49,0:29:29.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得有我在身边会安全得多吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think it'd be a lot safer with me around?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.89,0:29:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不相信你 特雷弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't trust you, Trevor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.48,0:29:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须让你相信我 对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am just gonna have to make sure that you do. Alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.97,0:29:42.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sorry, I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.11,0:29:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 他正要走 他是我前任男友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's just leaving. It's...it's my ex.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.26,0:29:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一一任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one and only.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.03,0:29:53.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见到你感觉很酷...正式地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cool to meet you...officially.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.25,0:29:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直想买一本你的书 但...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I keep meaning to pick up a copy of your book, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.79,0:30:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真人更娇小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're smaller in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.78,0:30:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.22,0:30:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是你...让我想起了自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you just...you remind me of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.95,0:30:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 记得锁好窗户 - 好的 晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lock your window, ok? - Yeah, goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.96,0:30:21.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.33,0:30:25.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉吓到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.72,0:30:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在走之前巡视一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just making my rounds before taking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.66,0:30:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好极 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.52,0:30:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不记得我了吗 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't remember me, do you? - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.28,0:30:41.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起上的高中 记得朱迪·希克斯吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We went to High School together. Judy Hicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.90,0:30:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在同一个课室 以及剧社{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had the same Homeroom in. Drama club too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.61,0:30:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起演过《小飞侠》{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were in Peter Pan together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.03,0:30:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我演其中一个迷失少年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I played a Lost Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.15,0:30:55.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是...泰格·莉莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were... Tiger Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.44,0:30:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 时间太久远了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sorry, it was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.20,0:31:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.17,0:31:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前发生的事情实在太多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had a lot of stuff going on back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.44,0:31:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴再见到你 朱迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's nice to see you again, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.19,0:31:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.66,0:31:19.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,楼上一切正常吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything ok upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.86,0:31:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该在前门外待着 铂金斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to be out front, Perkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.23,0:31:34.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,4字母单词代表...勇气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4 letter word for...courage?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.96,0:31:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胆量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.95,0:31:46.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是奥利维亚·莫里斯 住在隔壁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Olivia Morris, she lives next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.24,0:31:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在名单上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.76,0:31:50.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是她住在我隔壁就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can live next door to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.64,0:31:54.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说认真地 玛丽 我警告你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now seriously, Mary. I am warning you, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.53,0:31:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要动手了 我说真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am gonna have to get physical. I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.33,0:31:58.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 他妈的滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it! Just fuck off!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.09,0:32:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(奥利维亚)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.95,0:32:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你们在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - What are you guys up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.45,0:32:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在看《僵尸肖恩》{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhm, we re watching Shaun of the Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.27,0:32:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知不知道你们家外面车里有两只僵尸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know there's two zombies sitting outside your house in a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.39,0:32:19.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 他们是警察 你要过来吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they are cops. You wanna come up?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.48,0:32:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"死亡天使"走了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angel of Death leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.56,0:32:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 她住客房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, she's in the guest room.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.66,0:32:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 隔壁已经够近的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it. Next door is close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.37,0:32:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你妈在家吗 - 在她男朋友那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your mom home? - She's at her boyfriend's.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.83,0:32:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚这里更恐怖了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's creepier in here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.60,0:32:35.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,僵尸还在车里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the zombies are still in their car,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.04,0:32:37.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you should be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.88,0:32:39.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 明天打电话给我 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Call me tomorrow, ok? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.80,0:32:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她要过来吗 - 她害怕"死亡之神"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She wanna come up? - She fears the Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.15,0:32:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.82,0:32:57.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.38,0:32:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最喜欢的恐怖片是哪部 奥利维亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your favorite scary movie, Olivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.32,0:33:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我听过最差的模仿 吉尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the worst imitation I've ever heard, Jill.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.37,0:33:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起《刺杀》 你知道刺杀之夜在哪举行吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking of Stab, you heard where the Stab-a-thon's gonna be at?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.57,0:33:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 跟我没关系 反正我妈不让我去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It doesn't matter to me anyways, mom doesn't let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.84,0:33:14.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特雷弗打来的 让我来摆平吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Trevor, I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.25,0:33:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特雷弗又打来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trevor is calling...again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.04,0:33:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想怎样 - 我要跟吉尔说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you want? - I wanna talk to Jill.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.52,0:33:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是科比 抱歉 特雷弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhm, no it's Kirby. Sorry, Trevor,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.59,0:33:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉尔在清理她前任的那些通话记录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jill is screening her calls from all past relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.99,0:33:26.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们那边在干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.46,0:33:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 他说什么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on one sec. What is he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.64,0:33:30.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是特雷弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not Trevor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.44,0:33:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 我根本听不清 特雷弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I can barely hear you, Trevor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.41,0:33:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是特雷弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't Trevor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.35,0:33:39.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 那你为什么有他的电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, alright. Then why do you have his phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.64,0:33:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.09,0:33:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在假装鬼脸 - 诡异的很{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's trying to do Ghostface. - He's being weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.68,0:33:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想跟吉尔说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna talk to Jill.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.10,0:33:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不想跟你说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok, well, she doesn't want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.31,0:33:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 鬼脸先生 跟我说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Mr Ghostface, whisper to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.56,0:33:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是应该问我一个问题吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you supposed to ask me a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.60,0:33:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的 电影好看吗 - 什么电影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alright. How's the movie? - What movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.71,0:34:04.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 《僵尸肖恩》 - 你怎么知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shaun of the Dead. - How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.17,0:34:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我在衣柜里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm standing in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.29,0:34:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴 不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.32,0:34:12.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 特雷弗怪怪的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on? - Trevor is being weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.57,0:34:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道是不是他 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I mean, if it is him, I don't know. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.94,0:34:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我他妈不是特雷弗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not fucking Trevor!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.77,0:34:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你到底他妈的是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.94,0:34:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开衣柜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the closet door.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.42,0:34:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道房子周围都是警察吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do know there are cops all over this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.07,0:34:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信自己有时间把某人开膛破肚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that I have just enough time to slice someone open.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.35,0:34:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来跟他说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.38,0:34:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们那边怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on over there, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.72,0:34:37.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道 科比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, I don't know. Kirby?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.80,0:34:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.15,0:34:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 打开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.86,0:34:46.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不可能在里面 - 你自己看吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There is no way you re in there. - See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.69,0:34:50.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科比 求你了 告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirby? Kirby, come on, talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.94,0:34:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点不好玩 科比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't funny! Kirby!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.95,0:35:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骗子 我看过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liar. I am over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.26,0:35:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可没说在你的衣柜里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never said I was in your closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.28,0:35:12.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.09,0:35:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 奥利维亚 - 我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Olivia! - Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.59,0:35:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命 他在我家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help, in my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.28,0:35:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.84,0:35:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.10,0:35:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 霍斯 - 奥利维亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hoss! - Olivia!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.26,0:35:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铂金斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.90,0:35:50.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗屎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.00,0:36:47.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.78,0:36:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 西德尼 这只是前奏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home Sidney. Preview of coming events.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.62,0:36:52.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么不直接冲我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you come for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.78,0:36:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为自己说了算吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the balls for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.94,0:36:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怜的西德尼 你以为这全是因为你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, poor Sidney. You think this is all about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.05,0:36:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你还是明星吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you're still the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.15,0:36:59.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是他妈的电影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't a fucking movie!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.73,0:37:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 会的 - 他们都是无辜的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It will be. - These are innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.47,0:37:03.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少废话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spare me the lecture!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.15,0:37:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你因为这些鲜血名利双收{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done very well by all this blood shed, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.54,0:37:07.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被你遗忘的小镇呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about the town you left behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.94,0:37:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经为你设计好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got plans for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.99,0:37:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把你的眼皮撕成两半{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am gonna slit your eyelids in half
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.71,0:37:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样你就能亲眼看着我刺穿你的脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you don't blink when I stab you in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.55,0:37:17.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你几时死就几时死 西德尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll die when I want you to, Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.49,0:37:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一刻也不差 到那时有你受的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a moment before. Until then, you're going to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.80,0:37:26.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 西德尼 - 吉尔 别进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sidney! - Jill? Stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.67,0:37:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她是... - 不要看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is she... - Do not look, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.27,0:37:33.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说你是死亡天使{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said you were the Angel of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.49,0:37:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.81,0:37:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 过来看 那边 - 他在这里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come look. Look over there. - He's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.75,0:38:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 人呢 - 他刚刚在这...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is he? - He was...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.82,0:38:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那边怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your status?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.14,0:38:10.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 吉尔 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jill? - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.16,0:38:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 我的天 吉尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened? Oh my God, Jill.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.42,0:38:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天 宝贝 来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus. Baby, baby. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.76,0:38:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 我们走 我们走 让我照顾你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go, let's go. Let's get care of you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.13,0:38:34.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉尔 我的天 你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jill? Oh my God. Are you ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.64,0:38:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扶我一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.89,0:38:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,压住伤口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your pressure on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.07,0:38:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房子后面有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's somebody back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.31,0:38:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 叫他过来 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Call it in. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.36,0:38:44.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, are you ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.89,0:38:48.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该去楼上处理下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should look upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.93,0:39:02.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们各个角落都搜查一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get the corners and rub around these.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.51,0:39:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还以为已经了结了呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought this was over!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.17,0:39:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你的错 西德尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all your fault, Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.71,0:39:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你妈妈一样是扫帚星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like her mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.08,0:39:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉我刚刚说了过分的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sorry of what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.81,0:39:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要去看看伤口吧 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shouldn't you get that looked at? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.72,0:39:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.16,0:39:35.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前 我看见他往那边院子跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok, I saw him going to that yard,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.63,0:39:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在前面两座房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two houses down, right before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.05,0:39:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我绕过去想截住他 - 然后呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And I circled around to cut him off. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.26,0:39:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我就看见霍斯从另一个方向过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I met Hoss coming from the other direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.35,0:39:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他一定折回去了 跟鬼一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he must have circled back around somehow. He's like a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.45,0:39:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 长官 对不起 - 我们感觉很糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Chief, we're sorry. - We feel terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.13,0:39:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 先回去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright. Get out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.72,0:40:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是罗比·默塞尔主播的《嘿咻卡》{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Hall Pass with Robbie Mercer
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.74,0:40:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深夜现场网络直播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}webcasting live in our darkest hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.78,0:40:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为纪念日的一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What began as a day of remembrance,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.70,0:40:14.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终以连环谋杀收场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has ended with a serial murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.44,0:40:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个我泡不上的妞 死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who officially would never go out with me, is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.82,0:40:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍妮·兰德尔和玛妮·库铂也惨遭毒手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So is Jenny Randall and Marnie Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.46,0:40:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本地的传奇 《刺杀》系列电影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our local legacy, the Stab movies,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.65,0:40:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在变成现实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is coming to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.26,0:40:27.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 你们在用这个东西录像吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, are you recording with that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.14,0:40:28.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会上传到我的视频博客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My video blog upload.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.97,0:40:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他正在网络广播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's webcasting right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.20,0:40:31.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,介意关掉它吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind turning it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.25,0:40:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一所小破学校 上不了台面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little old school, off the record?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.04,0:40:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能关掉 听众听着呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't. Owe it to my audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.62,0:40:37.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 给我马上关掉 - 好吧...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Turn the fucking thing off. - Ok...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.32,0:40:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你们两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you two are the boys
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.87,0:40:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在伍兹伯勒高中搞电影俱乐部吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who run the movie club at Woodsboro High, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.60,0:40:44.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查理牵头的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Charlie rents it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.79,0:40:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是副手 他需要个得力助手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just VP, in case he takes a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.66,0:40:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们叫放映俱乐部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called Cinema Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.39,0:40:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想必你对学校里的电影迷们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you must have a very unique insight
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.12,0:40:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有相当独特的洞察力了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the movie buffs at your school?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.36,0:40:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.25,0:40:58.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们联手捉拿杀手 如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if we could catch the killer, by working together?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.72,0:41:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两代新锐新闻工作者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two generations of cutting edge journalists
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.98,0:41:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,共同为媒体事业献出热情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}intertwining our passions for media.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.38,0:41:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你应该说什么呢 - 说我爱你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What would you say? - I love you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.20,0:41:10.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.17,0:41:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你们提供我一些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you give me your expertise
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.32,0:41:14.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伍兹伯勒高中变态血案的专业见解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the gore geek scene at Woodsboro High
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.77,0:41:15.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者我可以给予一定回报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and maybe I give you something in return
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.19,0:41:20.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,例如 名人到访你们的放映俱乐部...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say, a celebrity visit to your Cinema Club...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.16,0:41:21.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.79,0:41:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西德尼行吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Sidney?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.38,0:41:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想请西德尼对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Sidney?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.49,0:41:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识她 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you know her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.54,0:41:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说 你和她是朋友吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean you're friends with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.49,0:41:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 但俱乐部会轰动的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No offense but, that'd be a big deal for some of the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.63,0:41:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西德尼·普雷斯科特到访 她可是个明星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A visit from Sidney Prescott, I mean, she's the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.50,0:41:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我是罗琳 那她就是丹尼尔·雷德克里夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yes she's Daniel Radcliffe to my J.K. Rowling.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.68,0:41:43.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的书拍成过电影吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When was the bookshelf in the box office?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.06,0:41:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.54,0:41:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有骨折 应该没有大碍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no broken bones. I think you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.02,0:41:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只需要休养几个星期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe just take a couple weeks off.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.20,0:41:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西德尼 长话短说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Sidney...Uh, ouh. Anyway, long story short ,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.66,0:42:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞德姆想跟你续签三本书 立刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Random wants to lock you into 3 more books, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.43,0:42:04.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看见合同里的空行了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See the blank line in your contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.59,0:42:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里签名就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can name your phrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.08,0:42:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一旦洗脱嫌疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as soon as you're clear in this investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.11,0:42:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就马上飞去纽约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're on the next plane to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.56,0:42:10.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我约了《今日新闻》《观点》{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I booked Today, The View,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.96,0:42:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南茜·格蕾丝 《音乐电视新闻》{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy Grace, mTV News.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.31,0:42:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我...我可以问个问题吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, can I...can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.79,0:42:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你读过我的书吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you read my book?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.21,0:42:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来打算等电影版{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought I'd wait for the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.63,0:42:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巡回签售到此结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Book tour is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.16,0:42:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西德尼 接受你的处境吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sidney. Accept your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.60,0:42:29.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个受害者 一直都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a victim, for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.29,0:42:32.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就拥抱它 利用它吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, embrace it, use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.12,0:42:34.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你在乎你的读者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you care about your readers.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.87,0:42:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些失败者需要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All those little down-trodden fucks that just need
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.02,0:42:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到前方的一丝光明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a light at the end of their tunnels
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.96,0:42:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不至于绝望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so they don't jump off a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.43,0:42:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以这次为契机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a lucky break like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.11,0:42:43.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,销售量能至少翻个倍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am talking a 100 percent increase in sales, minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.82,0:42:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能会又有一百万人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's maybe a million more people
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.73,0:42:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受到你的鼓舞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}getting your message
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.15,0:42:49.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你将会收到更多的报酬 双赢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you get a ton more checks. Win-win.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.38,0:42:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不再需要你了 - 西德尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I won't be needing you anymore. - Sidney!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.99,0:42:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你被解雇了 - 什么解雇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You re fired. - Fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.11,0:42:59.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 炒鱿鱼 - 行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fired! - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.42,0:43:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(医院主入口)
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.74,0:43:23.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"你觉得我的书怎样呢 丽贝卡"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"What do you think about my book, Rebecca?"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.23,0:43:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西德尼从来没被解雇过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The problem of Sidney is she never gets laid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.53,0:43:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至没吃过别人白眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or even a little shit faced once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.21,0:43:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,9点她就会打电话来道歉 等着瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll call me at 9 to apologize. Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.34,0:43:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(出口)
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.86,0:43:58.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会找我的 给她一点时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll come around. Gotta just give her time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.10,0:44:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西德尼会...来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sidney will come....around.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.72,0:44:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是丽贝卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.67,0:44:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找西德尼·普雷斯科特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sidney Prescott, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.02,0:44:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我负责普雷斯科特小姐的公关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am handling Ms Prescott's calls and appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.71,0:44:19.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以为你留言吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I take a message?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.39,0:44:22.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是留言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.69,0:44:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记好了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you writing this down?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.65,0:44:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正记着 但我听不太清{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I am. But, it's kinda hard to hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.33,0:44:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和西德尼在医院里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in a hospital, with Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.66,0:44:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以稍等一下吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can just hang on one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.18,0:44:37.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能等 但是你就不能了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got time. It's you that doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.34,0:44:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丽贝卡 你那边听起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Rebecca, it doesn't sound to me
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.90,0:44:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不太像医院啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like you're in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.42,0:44:52.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是在停车场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like you re in a parking garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.97,0:44:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昏暗荒芜的停车场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dark and deserted parking garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.73,0:45:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是如果你想去医院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you wanna be in the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.00,0:45:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很乐意送你去 太平间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be happy to put you there. In the morgue!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.81,0:45:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命 救命 救救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Help! Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.01,0:46:11.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神出鬼没 你这个杂种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut and run, you fucking bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.71,0:47:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(楼梯 六楼)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.58,0:47:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调查在进行中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is an ongoing investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.14,0:47:27.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 我们已有多条线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But rest assured, we're pursuing a number of leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.11,0:47:29.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 警长 - 我说的越少越好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sheriff. - The less I say about that, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.03,0:47:32.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那到了答疑时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I'm taking questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.30,0:47:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杜威 - 加尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dewey! - Gale?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.50,0:47:37.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这几起谋杀似乎是模仿最初的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any comment on the fact that these killings seem to resemble
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.71,0:47:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伍兹伯勒杀人案 你有何看法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the pattern of the original Woodsboro murders?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.24,0:47:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 等会再说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hun? Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.09,0:47:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么意思 警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that, Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.41,0:47:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如我所说的...警员们正在加紧破案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I was saying...my officers are hard at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.37,0:47:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只希望公众了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just want the community to know
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.08,0:47:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很快就能控制局面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we're very close to bringing this whole situation under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.29,0:48:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(KQWK 第十三频道 海湾地区新闻)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.29,0:48:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来人 到顶楼去看看 快去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, someone! Get up to the top of the structure! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.36,0:48:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都退后 - 后退 都不许动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everyone back! Stay back! - Back, nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.28,0:48:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹金斯 派人到楼梯井上看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jenkins, I want a man on this stairwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.86,0:48:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看见谁了吗 - 没人在那{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You see anybody? - Nobody out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.79,0:48:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里没人 警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nobody out there, Sheriff!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.26,0:48:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽在掌控中吗 警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all under control huh, Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.50,0:48:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我能怎么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what am I supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.69,0:48:26.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 可能我不是警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I may not be wearing a uniform,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.85,0:48:29.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我刚好有一条你没有的线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I happen to have a lead and you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.85,0:48:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想合作的时候通知我一声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let me know when you're back on Team Gale.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.30,0:48:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后退 我是警长家的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move back, I am the Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.90,0:48:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(伍兹伯勒高中)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.30,0:48:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(放映俱乐部)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.17,0:48:49.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 伙计们 我们现在开讲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok, Cinema Club, we're now in session.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.36,0:48:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(刺杀)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.10,0:48:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(活死人黎明)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.84,0:48:55.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是一个被认可的学校团体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're a sanctioned after school activity,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.79,0:48:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,位于合唱团楼下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one rung below the Glee club,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.26,0:48:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任天堂游戏健身楼上两层{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two above Nintendo Wii Fit
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.82,0:49:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,容我先向我们的特邀嘉宾致敬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and let me just say to our guest,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.75,0:49:05.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西德尼·普雷斯科特 非常荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sidney Prescott, it's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.41,0:49:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的加入就是终极体验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, this is the ultimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.53,0:49:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,估计我该说谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, I-I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.90,0:49:18.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这...你把全部校园生活拍成电影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This, uhm...you film your entire High School experience
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.13,0:49:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后呢 传到网上吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and what, post it on the net?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.35,0:49:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这早晚会成为一种趋势 西德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody will be doing it someday, Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.10,0:49:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这正是凶手所遗漏的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's kind of the one component the killer is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.39,0:49:25.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.33,0:49:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要想成为新的"新版本"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you wanna be the new "New version",
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.43,0:49:31.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凶手应该拍下谋杀过程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the killer should be filming the murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.38,0:49:33.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是精神凌虐创新中很自然的一步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's like the natural next step in the psycho slasher innovation.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.94,0:49:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说 你实时拍下谋杀场景{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean you film em all real time
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.73,0:49:37.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后在被抓前 上传到网上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then before you get caught, you upload em into cyberspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.71,0:49:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你的杰作与你一起永存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Making your art as immortal as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.33,0:49:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是指他... - 不是指我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not to implicate him... - Not to implicate me...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.13,0:49:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你认为谁是凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So who do you think is behind the murders?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.22,0:49:48.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然是个《刺杀》迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's a Stab fanatic, clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.19,0:49:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不太注重布景 更注重气氛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Working on less of a Screquel and more of a Screamake.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.02,0:49:52.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便一提 我们独创的词汇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copyrighted terms, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.91,0:49:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为现在这一切都是重演{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cos all there are now are remakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.68,0:49:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制片厂只给恐怖片放行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only horror the studios green-light.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.87,0:50:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,规则还在 只是已经变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, there are still rules, but the rules have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.02,0:50:01.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的陈腔滥调是不被允许的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The unexpected is the new cliche.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.53,0:50:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 你必须有惊人的开场白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you gotta have an opening sequence that blows the doors off
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.39,0:50:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,配上超炫的音乐视频录制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}done with some flashy music video direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.54,0:50:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀戮就需要更加极端{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the kills gotta be way more extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.50,0:50:11.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的观众对原来的规则很熟悉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Modern audiences got savvy to the rules of the originals,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.39,0:50:13.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以反其道而行成了新的规则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so the reversals become the new standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.47,0:50:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 现在的恐怖片里你想活命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, the only surefire way to survive
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.83,0:50:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一的可能性就是 你是同性恋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a modern horror movie, you pretty much have to be gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.89,0:50:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你如何确定凶手是在故事重现呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, why are you so sure that the killer is working by the rules of a horror remake?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.63,0:50:28.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电影《刺杀》的结构非常清晰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the original Stab structure is pretty apparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.29,0:50:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父母外出时两个孩子在家里被杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two kids killed in a house while their parents are away.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.71,0:50:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后校花被摧残得面目全非{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then the school's "Hot chick" savaged beyond recognition.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.33,0:50:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都知道下一次在哪里...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all know where it goes from there...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.12,0:50:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派对上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A party.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.50,0:50:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是 第三起肯定血流成河{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly. A party. Guaranteed third act main cast blood bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.44,0:50:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,期待出现裸体美人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fingers crossed on some nudity for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.72,0:50:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道今晚的派对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok, do you know of a party that's happening tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.72,0:50:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有个刺杀之夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's Stab-a-thon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.73,0:50:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刺杀之夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stab-a-thon?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.04,0:50:54.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一个电影循环放映{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, It's a movie marathon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.04,0:50:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全七部《刺杀》连续播放{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All 7 Stabs back to back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.50,0:50:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每年都举行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do it every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.72,0:50:58.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是今晚吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.62,0:51:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,模仿原版电影的凶手还在逍遥法外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a killer out there patterning his murders after the original movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.14,0:51:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 很疯狂吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, it's pretty wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.02,0:51:06.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须取消派对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to call it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.38,0:51:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说 今天是周五{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhm, ok, I mean, it's Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.27,0:51:11.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这肯定不是伍兹伯勒唯一的派对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sure we're not the only party that's going on at Woodsboro.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.36,0:51:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个蠢派对在哪里举行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But where is this circle-jerk gonna take place?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.08,0:51:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那现在是提问时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, let's ready for this Q&A.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.81,0:51:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 我要知道地址{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. I really want the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.39,0:51:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是秘密集会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's kind of an underground thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.52,0:51:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通过邮件邀请 非常隐秘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Email invites. Pretty secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.77,0:51:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你不打算告诉我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you're not gonna tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.44,0:51:28.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 我们是搭档 忘了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? We're working together. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.32,0:51:33.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那开始提问吧 - 去你的 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you're ready for the Q&A? - Fuck you. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.80,0:51:39.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,酷毙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.64,0:51:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 未经允许谁也不准靠近屋子 - 明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nobody comes to the house unless we say so. - Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.43,0:51:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉我被软禁一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like I'm under house arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.89,0:52:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道有人说"我了解你的感受"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know when people say "I know how you feel",
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.10,0:52:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可你知道他们只是说说而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you know they're just saying that
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.94,0:52:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他们根本就不懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because they really have no freaking idea how you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.24,0:52:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解你的感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.80,0:52:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥利维亚的事我感到很难过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so sorry about Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.25,0:52:27.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你公关的事我也很难过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sorry about your publicist.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.24,0:52:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一直盯着你 你怎么受得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you handle it, people staring at you all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.59,0:52:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家有盯着我吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People stare at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.15,0:52:43.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我永远应付不来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could never handle that kind of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.52,0:52:46.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我感觉那会颠覆你的全部生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just feel like it would take over your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.14,0:52:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我唯一做的就是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, all I do is I...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.34,0:52:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试着不去想自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}try not to think about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.59,0:53:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有要关心的人 我关注他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have people I care about. I focus on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.42,0:53:07.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至于其他的 就顺其自然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the rest, uhm, it works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.88,0:53:12.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你昨晚救了我的命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved my life last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.40,0:53:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我们是家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I know we're family
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.60,0:53:15.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...你察觉到我出事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but... you heard a thing on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.19,0:53:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我疑惑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Makes me wonder, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.06,0:53:22.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己是否有勇气做同样的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I'd be brave enough to do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.25,0:53:26.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真心希望你永远不必知道答案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really hope you never have to find that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.47,0:53:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要我的话 你知道去哪找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, if you need me, you know where to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.75,0:53:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在我牢房里 我是说 房间里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be up in my cell, oh, I mean, my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.86,0:54:02.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的房间被木板封上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our rooms are boarded up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.84,0:54:06.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从我的小屋能看到 太奇怪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the view from my cell. It's really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.20,0:54:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得奥利维亚会理解的 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Olivia would understand, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.66,0:54:10.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也希望我出来散散心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'd want me to be around other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.55,0:54:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真见鬼 我竟然到了蠢蛋聚集区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit. Even if I did just crash land on planet dork.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.46,0:54:20.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 顺便一提 特雷弗在这里 - 科比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Speaking of which, Trevor's here. - Hey, Kirby.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.48,0:54:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在那干吗 这不像他的作风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is he doing there? That is so not his scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.80,0:54:25.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 或许他以为你会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no idea, maybe he thought you would be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.53,0:54:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 太有可能了 经过昨晚的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, fat chance. After what happened last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.02,0:54:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈完全吓坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, my mum is just completely freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.37,0:54:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 又不是第一次 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's not prim. - Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.21,0:54:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当你的乖乖女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you go do your good girl thing
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.20,0:54:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会替你把你的那份酒喝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll drink for the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.03,0:54:36.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会一直更新状态的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will keep you posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.65,0:54:38.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 注意安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.65,0:55:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刺杀之夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stab-a-thon!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.96,0:55:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刺杀之夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stab-a-thon!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.83,0:55:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你们 谢谢 - 安静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you! Thank you. Gracias. Gracias. - Shhhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.16,0:55:34.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放映俱乐部感谢各位来参加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cinema Club thanks you for
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.33,0:55:36.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躁动派对3周年聚会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coming up for our third annual Stab-a-thon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.26,0:55:37.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 参加3周年聚会的各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, number-3-thon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.72,0:55:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢你们光临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thank you in rows.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.45,0:55:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好在手机没信号时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready to drink every time
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.60,0:55:42.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 痛饮了吗 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- someone can't get a cellphone signal? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.59,0:55:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好在关冰箱门时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready to drink every time someone shuts the refrigerator door and,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.94,0:55:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪 有人躲在门后时痛饮了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}oh my God, there's the harmless character right behind it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.50,0:55:49.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.96,0:55:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们准备好在有人大喊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready to drink
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.29,0:55:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那个词时痛饮了吗... - 不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- every time somebody screams the word.... - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.96,0:55:57.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们开始刺杀之夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get the Stab-a-thon started!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.10,0:56:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(刺杀)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.10,0:56:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ghostface!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.57,0:56:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五秒内离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out in 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.96,0:56:19.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快挪开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.88,0:56:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我滚蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.99,0:56:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(根据加尔·威瑟斯的《伍兹伯勒谋杀》改编)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.18,0:56:58.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.20,0:57:07.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 我的好戏上场了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Yeah. Back on my game.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.24,0:57:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完美 新任务进行中 第一章{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect. New work in progress, chapter 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.83,0:57:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我搬到伍兹伯勒时 我从未想过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I moved to Woodsboro, I never in a million years dreamed
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.83,0:57:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会再次担负重任...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I would again play the critical role...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.54,0:57:22.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解救另一群...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in solving another series of these...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.78,0:57:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.28,0:57:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加尔 你在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gale, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.50,0:57:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟踪那帮孩子到了刺杀之夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I followed the kids to the Stab-a-thon.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.18,0:58:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在迪伦四路的一个废旧农场里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an old abandoned farm on 4th Dylan Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.96,0:58:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我放了监控器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I-I got it under surveillance,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.66,0:58:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我认为凶手就要行动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I think the killer is about to make his move.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.48,0:58:07.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何以见得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.79,0:58:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,故事重演来超越经典{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do a remake to outdo the original,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.50,0:58:12.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是那帮孩子说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's what the kids said.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.40,0:58:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个派对的主题就是《刺杀》电影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This party is all about the Stab movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.90,0:58:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 你还要多少证明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, how meta can you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.97,0:58:19.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么"什么"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How "What the.." Can you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.37,0:58:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不清楚 我跟他们学的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dunno, I heard em say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.00,0:58:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杜威 听我说 你得赶快过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dewey, listen to me, you have to get out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.75,0:58:26.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 你抓凶手 我抢新闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you catch the killer, I get the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.28,0:58:27.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双赢啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a win-win.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.36,0:58:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你是太闲了 加尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I thought you were going rogue, Gale.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.75,0:58:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托...你是认真的吗 拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh come..Are you serious? C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.29,0:58:36.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 谢谢你对我的信任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it. Thanks for having faith in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.65,0:58:39.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要去修设备了 - 加尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I gotta fix my equipment. - Gale!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.04,0:58:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.19,0:59:02.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了 干得不错 让我印象深刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo, well...very well done, very, I'm very impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.35,0:59:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点 挺不错 不见得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of. Kinda impressed. Not Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.53,0:59:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就足够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.74,0:59:07.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 够了吗 - 足够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.34,0:59:09.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没错 她想要你 - 是的 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, she wants you. - Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.52,0:59:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.53,0:59:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼脸...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ghostface...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.51,0:59:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好吗 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.82,0:59:31.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.62,0:59:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在等谁吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you expecting somebody now?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.19,0:59:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗 虽然不知道你是谁...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I don't even know you...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.01,0:59:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经开始讨厌你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I dislike you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.99,0:59:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希克斯 你离迪伦四路多远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hicks, how far are you from 4th Dylan Road?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.34,0:59:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最多5分钟就能到 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}5 minutes at the most, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.85,0:59:50.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快赶过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.01,0:59:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看窗外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out your window.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.77,1:00:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(一号摄像机 正在录制)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.73,1:00:42.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加尔 加尔 注意身后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gale! Gale, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.38,1:00:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.94,1:00:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gale!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.33,1:01:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.93,1:01:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快让开 你们这群蠢蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way, you morons!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.06,1:01:37.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.52,1:01:44.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 用力按住 - 你抓住他了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ok, put pressure on that. - Did you catch him?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.69,1:01:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 希望你的监视器拍到些什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, hopefully your cameras got something.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.55,1:01:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是只有我放了监视器 杜威{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They weren't the only ones, Dewey.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.94,1:01:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 有个摄像头...在那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - There's a webcam... set back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.21,1:01:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在观察我 - 摄像头吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He was watching me. - A webcam?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.48,1:01:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在拍摄谋杀过程 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's recording the murders. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.58,1:02:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次...他要拍成电影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time... he's making the movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.54,1:02:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个西德尼·普雷斯科特推销员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This Sidney Prescott detail man,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.78,1:02:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.48,1:02:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,监控房子的警察都明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cops scouting the house, they always get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.97,1:02:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说什么呢 - 这是电影的警察规则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you talking about? - It's a movie cop rule.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.92,1:02:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当电影里的警察糟透了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sucks to be a cop in a movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.82,1:02:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你是布鲁斯·威利斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you're Bruce Willis.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.22,1:02:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是所有电影里的警察都会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not all cops die in movies.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.18,1:02:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 但如果你明天退休 你死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but if it's your last day before retirement you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.53,1:02:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是老婆怀孕了的新手 你死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're a rookie, some with a wife who's pregnant, you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.85,1:02:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者要是你的搭档比你帅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or if your partner is better looking than you,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.06,1:02:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死定了 顺便一提 我比较帅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you do, and by the way, I win that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.14,1:02:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我去巡逻吧 一会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, I'll take the next perimeter. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.33,1:02:46.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.12,1:02:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的 你不该那么说 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this one, you're not supposed to say that, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.07,1:02:51.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新时代 会有新规则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eh, new decade, new rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.21,1:02:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今 你可能回来后发现我死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, these days, you might come back, find me dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.21,1:02:57.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两眼突出 舌头外伸 都有可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes gouged out, tongue sticking out. Could go either way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.33,1:03:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我得学会这套 - 这回我去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I gotta learn this shit. - Eh, I'll take this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.48,1:03:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍斯 小心点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Hoss. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.36,1:03:08.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我行事一向小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am always careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.60,1:03:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赴死之旅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead man walking.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.53,1:04:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铂金斯 你上次巡逻时有窗户开着吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perkins, was there a window open on your last perimeter check?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.73,1:04:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铂金斯 请回复 完毕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perkins, come in. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.97,1:04:46.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安东尼 铂金斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anthony? Perkins?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.95,1:04:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 你真该看看自己的脸 新手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dammit. - You should have seen the look on your face, rookie.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.14,1:05:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍斯 搞什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hoss! What the fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.28,1:05:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真见鬼...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.07,1:05:14.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hoss!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.52,1:05:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的布鲁斯·威利斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck Bruce Willis!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.93,1:06:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 风铃放在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. The wind chimes were over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.53,1:06:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我放的 我想把它修好 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was me, I was trying to fix em, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.20,1:06:10.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚从商店回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am just back the store.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.70,1:06:12.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去买东西了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you shopping?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.57,1:06:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去释放压力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A stress buster.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.95,1:06:16.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车里还有一袋东西 我马上回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got one more bag in the car. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.05,1:06:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉尔 能接下电话吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jill, you're gonna get that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.86,1:06:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗伯茨家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roberts residence.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.85,1:06:52.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个幸存者 对吧 西德尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a survivor, aren't you, Sidney?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.13,1:06:54.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你唯一会的就是:死里逃生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your one and only skill: You survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.94,1:06:57.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个问题要问你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I have one question for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.14,1:06:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当亲近你的人都死光了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What good did to be a survivor in
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.93,1:07:02.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个幸存者是不是还感觉良好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this little drama if everyone close to you is dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.22,1:07:06.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 打开电视 看6频道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - Turn on the TV to channel 6.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.21,1:07:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.30,1:07:09.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开电视 看预告片吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn it on. Watch the teaser.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.57,1:07:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚险些有人丧命 这次的受害者是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it nearly turned deadly tonight, with the latest victim
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.99,1:07:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伍兹伯勒警长的妻子...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of this attack being the wife of the Woodsboro Sheriff...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.56,1:07:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加尔·瑞利 原名加尔·威瑟斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gale Riley, AKA Gale Weathers, who's in serious
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.51,1:07:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被严重刺伤 而袭击者...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}condition tonight after being stabbed. Her assailant then disappeared...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.76,1:07:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 趁乱逃逸... - 欢迎回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- in a sea of identic.... - Glad you came home,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.69,1:07:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西德尼 值得吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sidney. Has it been worth it yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.84,1:07:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你为什么要这么做 - 朋友也行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you doing this? - Ah, friends count,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.19,1:07:36.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是家人可以伤害你更深 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's the family ties that cut deep. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.57,1:07:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思 - 你最关心的那些人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you mean? - The ones you care about most.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.11,1:07:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有谁能比家人呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what's closer than family?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.20,1:07:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 血缘的羁绊 - 别这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The bond of blood. - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.53,1:07:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你救不了他们 你只能眼睁睁地看着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't save them. All you can do is watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.92,1:07:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jill!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.51,1:08:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(- 我妈快把我逼疯了 过来接我 - 马上到)
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.51,1:08:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 凯特 - 西德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kate! - Sid?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.24,1:08:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她不在房间里 - 天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's not in her room. - Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.27,1:08:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她去了科比家 你得给她打电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gone at Kirby's. You gotta call her,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.66,1:08:16.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让她回来 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- get her back here. - Ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.93,1:08:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 接电话 吉尔 - 请留言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Jill! - Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.12,1:08:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她没接 怎么了 - 凶手打电话来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's not picking up. What's going on? - The killer called,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.32,1:08:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在跟踪我 他想先杀了我的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's coming after me. But he wants my family first.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.00,1:08:28.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 天哪 吉尔... - 我们去叫警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh God, Jill... - Let's get the cops.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.47,1:08:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 警察不在那 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The cops aren't there. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.79,1:08:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我第一次进来的时候他们还在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were there when I first came in,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.17,1:08:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但现在不在了 - 我们去科比家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- but they're not there now. - Let's get to Kirby's.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.37,1:08:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走正门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out the front.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.97,1:08:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能从底下撑住门吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Press up on the bottom. Can you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.77,1:08:57.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.08,1:09:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯特 快点 凯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kate, come on! Kate!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.37,1:09:15.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉吉尔我很抱歉...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell Jill I am so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.49,1:09:17.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 不...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no, shhhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.33,1:09:30.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯特...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kate...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.90,1:09:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希克斯 你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hicks. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.38,1:09:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚看见有人在房子周边晃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just saw somebody coming around the side of the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.98,1:09:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍斯和铂金斯哪去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are Hoss and Perkins?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.07,1:09:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无线电联络不到他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't get em on the radio.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.57,1:09:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁的血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose blood is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.27,1:09:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是...凯特的 我们刚被袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is...Is Kate's, we were just attacked.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.00,1:09:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.91,1:10:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她在哪 - 正门那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is she? - The front door.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.56,1:10:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 带我去 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Show me. - Ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.75,1:10:09.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 待在这 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay here. - Ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.86,1:10:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是希克斯副警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Deputy Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.87,1:10:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗伯茨家发生凶杀案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a homicide at the Roberts residence.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.98,1:10:21.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍斯和铂金斯失踪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sign of Perkins or Hoss.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.73,1:10:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到 我们会试着定位他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that. We'll try to locate em.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.51,1:10:24.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.01,1:10:38.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会没事的 好吗 我发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna be fine, alright? I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.99,1:10:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不再独自一人 我们永远在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more on your own. It's you and me, forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.08,1:10:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轻点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.55,1:10:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杜威 - 什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dewey. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.42,1:10:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 答应我一件事 - 任何事都答应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Promise me something. - Anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.85,1:10:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住那个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catch that motherfucker.
