Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.84,1:27:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切准备就绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've gone thru everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.76,1:27:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们时间把握得很准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're definitely good on timeline.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.17,1:27:59.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我们是绝配{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. We're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.86,1:28:01.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不 求求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.79,1:28:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好第3幕了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready for act 3?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.57,1:28:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜到了吗 西德尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have figured it out yet, Sidney?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.89,1:28:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据故事重演的原则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keeping it to our remake theme,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.09,1:28:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特雷弗是新一代的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trevor is this generation's
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.83,1:28:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利·卢姆斯(西德尼前男友及凶手){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy Loomis
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.69,1:28:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们是无辜的受害者:西德尼和兰迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we're the innocent victims: Sidney and Randy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.07,1:28:23.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你 全世界将知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, with you, the world just heard
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.62,1:28:27.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生的一切 关于我们 他们会看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about what happened but with us, they're gonna see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.55,1:28:29.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这会轰动全球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be a worldwide sensation. And
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.92,1:28:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们都会看到这个视频{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}people gotta see this shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.43,1:28:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这比看书要强多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like anyone reads anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.35,1:28:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会名扬四海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gonna know fame like you never even dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.74,1:28:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个少年幸存了下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last two teenagers standing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.58,1:28:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次兰迪终于得到了自己的女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time Randy gets the girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.49,1:28:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太神奇了 完美的受害者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're amazing. And you're the perfect victim.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.51,1:28:58.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是太不可思议了 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was so unbelievable today, wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.15,1:29:01.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我撒了那么多谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I told so many lies,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.49,1:29:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我几乎自己都要相信了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I actually started to believe them.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.91,1:29:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真觉得自己是个天生的戏子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really think that I was born for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.04,1:29:08.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么能这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.44,1:29:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道生在这种家庭的感受吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what it was like growing up in this family?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.49,1:29:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为你的亲人 听到的一直是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Related to you? I mean, all I ever heard was
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.83,1:29:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西德尼这个 西德尼那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sidney this and Sidney that,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.43,1:29:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西德尼 西德尼 西德尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Sidney, Sidney, Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.01,1:29:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是该死的特殊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were always so fucking special!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.32,1:29:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在轮到我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now I am the special one.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.32,1:29:29.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会成功的 向来如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll slip, they always do.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.02,1:29:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 查理 让我们开始吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Charlie. Let's go on with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.70,1:29:38.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须坚强 忍着点 知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to be strong and hold still. Ok?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.53,1:29:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对对 老法子 就像比利和斯图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, old school, like Billy and Stu.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.63,1:29:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 宝贝 加把劲 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, baby, get it up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.06,1:29:48.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朝这捅 朝这捅 朝这捅 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoulder me, shoulder me, shoulder me. Get it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.70,1:29:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很痛 我们不是这样排练的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hurts! Not the way we rehearsed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.37,1:29:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像你说的 查理 比利和斯图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said it, Charlie: Billy and Stu.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.20,1:30:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特雷弗和你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trevor and you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.07,1:30:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么才是媒体的最爱 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the media really loves, baby,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.91,1:30:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一的幸存者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a sole survivor.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.60,1:30:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道该是谁吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just ask you know who.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.91,1:30:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特雷弗是你的搭档{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trevor was your partner and you,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.13,1:30:12.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你则是主谋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were the idea man.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.05,1:30:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你连朋友都杀吗 - 我朋友吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Even your friends? - My friends?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.94,1:30:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你搞清楚没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What world are you living in?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.97,1:30:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要朋友 我需要粉丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need friends. I need fans.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.84,1:30:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不明白吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you get it?!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.10,1:30:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀你不是最终目的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This has never been about killing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.48,1:30:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最终是要...成为你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about...becoming you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.22,1:30:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了该死的这个 我妈必须死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, for fuck's sake, my own mother had to die,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.91,1:30:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在又死了这么多 我忠实了原著{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now great loss there, so I could stay true to the original.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.28,1:30:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很病态 是吗 可病态也是一种清醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sick, right? Well sick is the new sane.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.99,1:30:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有你的辉煌 现在我想要我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had your 15 minutes, now I want mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.12,1:31:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该做什么呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.40,1:31:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上大学 毕业 工作吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to college, grad school, work?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.61,1:31:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看周围 我们都活在公众的目光下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look around, we all live in public now,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.33,1:31:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活在网络世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're all on the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.33,1:31:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为人怎样才能出名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you think people become famous anymore?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.29,1:31:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本不需要去争取{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to achieve anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.41,1:31:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只需要等着机会找上你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just gotta have fucked up shit happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.85,1:31:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你必须死 西德 这是规则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you do have to die Sid. Those are the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.24,1:31:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新电影 新主题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New movie, new franchise.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.28,1:31:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主角只有一个 面对现实吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only room for one lead and, let's face it,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.93,1:31:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你纯真的日子 已经结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your ingenue days, they are over.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.09,1:31:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别告诉我你没预料到今天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me you didn't know this day would come.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.81,1:33:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.67,1:34:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快快 我们进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Let's move in!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.33,1:34:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 去各处房间检查一下 - 遵命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Check the rooms, both sides and upstairs. - Yes, Ma'm.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.75,1:34:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉尔 能描述一下发生的事吗...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jill can you give us a description...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.70,1:34:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这里...吉尔...吉尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here...Jill...Jill,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.11,1:35:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当英雄感觉如何...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does it feel to be a hero?...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.35,1:35:19.91,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(伍兹伯勒社区医院)
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.95,1:35:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉尔 你活着 这是最重要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jill. You made it. That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.40,1:35:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 查理和特雷要杀我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}True, Charlie and Trev tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.77,1:35:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说他们杀了我妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I heard they killed my mom. And
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.12,1:35:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比和科比也死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robbie and Kirby too.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.12,1:35:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别想了 休息吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shhh. Just lay back. Try to rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.30,1:35:43.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妻子还好吗...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is...is your wife...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.94,1:35:48.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她没事 她很坚强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gonna be fine. She's tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.75,1:35:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我有一天想写书了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I ever write a book one day I'd,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.02,1:35:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和她合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd want her to write it with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.49,1:35:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的伤口都一样 这是天意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'd be a good team with our matching wounds and all.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.69,1:36:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都是幸存者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're survivors now.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.22,1:36:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真希望西德尼也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wish Sidney was too.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.50,1:36:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉尔 他们还不确定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jill, they're not sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.43,1:36:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在抢救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's still touch and go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.62,1:36:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在她在加护病房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she's in ICU and
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.69,1:36:18.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们认为她能挺过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they think Sidney just might make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.64,1:36:23.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 我是说 我看见特雷弗杀了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I mean, I saw Trevor kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.35,1:36:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还不确定 她还在挣扎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, we don't know yet. But she's hanging on.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.57,1:36:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...我...我想见她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...I...I wanna see her.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.77,1:36:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还没醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not awake yet. And,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.71,1:36:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可能会失忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she may not remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.93,1:36:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能需要你帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll have to help her with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.04,1:36:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不着急 好好休息 好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All in time. Just get some rest now, ok?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.57,1:37:35.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She gonna be ok?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.81,1:37:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 她很坚强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, she's a strong kid.
